01:36:30.918 --> 01:36:34.046
You see Food speaks for itself

817
01:36:35.523 --> 01:36:37.753
A person who cooks me this food

818
01:36:39.426 --> 01:36:40.757
could never shoot me

819
01:36:44.832 --> 01:36:46.561
Do you love her?

820
01:36:48.936 --> 01:36:50.767
I knew you'd ask

821
01:36:52.339 --> 01:36:54.364
Human relationship is
not that simple

822
01:36:55.643 --> 01:36:56.575
Love?

823
01:36:59.146 --> 01:37:02.274
If you think love is the color red,

824
01:37:02.349 --> 01:37:07.286
there can be purple
love Or blue love

825
01:37:11.959 --> 01:37:14.792
Or yellow, black and white love

826
01:37:16.864 --> 01:37:21.301
<i>Your call is being</i>
<i>transferred to voice-mail</i>

827
01:37:24.772 --> 01:37:26.899
<i>Your cali...</i>

828
01:37:34.181 --> 01:37:35.808
That's nice and sweet

829
01:37:39.787 --> 01:37:43.314
<i>Are you taking care of yourself?</i>

830
01:37:48.395 --> 01:37:53.128
<i>In investigating Congressman Park's slush</i>
<i>funds the prosecution has acquired a hard drive</i>

831
01:37:53.200 --> 01:37:56.829
<i>that contains info tied</i>
<i>to Yoon Doo-heon,</i>

832
01:37:56.904 --> 01:37:58.929
<i>the former CEO of Hangang Industries</i>

833
01:37:59.006 --> 01:38:03.841
<i>However, Yoon is missing,</i>
<i>making the investigation difficult</i>

834
01:38:05.913 --> 01:38:10.441
He said he'll leave with all the accusations
if we call off the hit on him

835
01:38:13.721 --> 01:38:17.657
As long as he takes all the blame,

836
01:38:17.725 --> 01:38:20.751
we have nothing
to lose anyway

837
01:38:21.829 --> 01:38:25.265
<i>But he'll still be alive</i>
<i>with all the info</i>

838
01:38:28.035 --> 01:38:29.662
He'll live like a dead man

839
01:38:32.239 --> 01:38:33.365
Madame Kang

840
01:38:34.241 --> 01:38:37.677
<i>I thought you were the best.</i>
<i>I'm disappointed</i>

841
01:38:38.646 --> 01:38:43.276
My apologies Yoon will be a goner before
he leaves the country

842
01:38:51.558 --> 01:38:53.788
Did you find out?

843
01:38:54.461 --> 01:38:57.487
I talked to the guy
who knows the girls

844
01:38:57.564 --> 01:39:01.796
Eun-jung's alive but
she's been sold off

845
01:39:02.469 --> 01:39:06.496
I think she went
looking for her

846
01:39:14.281 --> 01:39:15.908
Chul-Soo

847
01:39:16.984 --> 01:39:19.714
I'll find her and
send her to you

848
01:39:21.088 --> 01:39:23.921
If you don't leave today,
you'll be in danger

849
01:41:21.108 --> 01:41:22.439
Wanna a new bike?

850
01:42:07.454 --> 01:42:08.580
Hey

851
01:42:26.874 --> 01:42:27.898
Why did you follow me?

852
01:42:29.776 --> 01:42:31.403
You'll die if you stay

853
01:42:33.080 --> 01:42:35.913
I told you to leave this country

854
01:42:37.084 --> 01:42:39.609
I don't die that easily

855
01:42:40.888 --> 01:42:42.412
They'll never give up

856
01:42:42.489 --> 01:42:44.116
I won't either

857
01:42:52.499 --> 01:42:53.124
Get in

858
01:46:15.702 --> 01:46:18.227
Really? I understand

859
01:46:28.315 --> 01:46:34.151
Your friend isn't working at a bar
It's a bit complicated

860
01:46:35.522 --> 01:46:37.046
I'll go alone

861
01:46:40.026 --> 01:46:41.050
This is my affair

862
01:46:54.241 --> 01:46:55.367
You leave first

863
01:46:56.143 --> 01:46:57.667
I'll follow you with Eun-jung

864
01:47:01.548 --> 01:47:03.175
You'll die if you stay

865
01:47:05.852 --> 01:47:09.686
You want to die for a girl like me?

866
01:47:09.756 --> 01:47:11.690
Who says I'm gonna die?

867
01:47:15.862 --> 01:47:21.892
I'm... a thug

868
01:47:25.972 --> 01:47:28.202
But my mom was
killed by a thug

869
01:47:35.882 --> 01:47:38.407
The one person I've
trusted as my own

870
01:47:43.290 --> 01:47:45.224
stabs me in the back

871
01:47:50.597 --> 01:47:52.121
Death doesn't matter anymore

872
01:47:54.801 --> 01:47:58.737
So you came all the way here
to give this to me?

873
01:48:03.210 --> 01:48:04.541
What am I?

874
01:48:07.214 --> 01:48:08.442
What am I?

875
01:48:12.819 --> 01:48:13.843
You don't know...

876
01:48:18.925 --> 01:48:21.450
how good your pollack soup taste

877
01:48:26.933 --> 01:48:33.065
or how pretty you are
when you cook

878
01:48:40.247 --> 01:48:46.186
I want you to be happy

879
01:49:34.701 --> 01:49:36.635
<i>Hide the drugs well inside the salt</i>

880
01:49:36.703 --> 01:49:37.931
<i>Yes boss</i>

881
01:49:42.208 --> 01:49:43.232
Who're you?

882
01:50:32.559 --> 01:50:36.290
Hey, Se-bin It's me

883
01:50:36.363 --> 01:50:38.194
You OK?

884
01:50:38.264 --> 01:50:40.289
I'm OK

885
01:50:40.367 --> 01:50:41.493
Eun-jung

886
01:50:42.369 --> 01:50:44.098
<i>Where are you?</i>

887
01:50:47.474 --> 01:50:48.406
<i>Hello?</i>

888
01:50:51.478 --> 01:50:52.604
<i>Hello?</i>

889
01:50:53.179 --> 01:50:54.908
I can get a good shot from here

890
01:51:08.995 --> 01:51:10.929
<i>Se-bin: Don't look for Eun-jung</i>
<i>Cali me now</i>

891
01:52:05.552 --> 01:52:06.382
I'll kill him

892
01:52:06.453 --> 01:52:08.080
You think I'd believe you?

893
01:52:08.154 --> 01:52:09.485
He'll die anyway

894
01:52:10.457 --> 01:52:11.685
<i>He must die</i>

895
01:52:13.359 --> 01:52:14.485
I want to do it

896
01:53:18.825 --> 01:53:20.452
Everything's so blue

897
01:53:24.130 --> 01:53:25.654
- Hey
- Hey

898
01:53:56.563 --> 01:53:57.894
Do you think

899
01:54:00.967 --> 01:54:02.901
a person can cry enough
tears to fill a salt pan?

900
01:54:03.870 --> 01:54:05.098
Don't know

901
01:54:08.374 --> 01:54:10.103
Even if they cry a lifetime,
it will be tough

902
01:54:19.385 --> 01:54:20.613
You got a gun?

903
01:54:28.294 --> 01:54:29.727
No silencer?

904
01:54:37.503 --> 01:54:39.130
Hey

905
01:54:43.910 --> 01:54:44.934
I'm sorry

906
01:56:48.334 --> 01:56:49.562
Boss!

907
01:57:02.548 --> 01:57:04.880
Look at all these!
Thanks

908
01:57:10.757 --> 01:57:12.782
You caught another one of those

909
01:57:13.659 --> 01:57:17.288
Great job, sir You're great

910
01:57:17.363 --> 01:57:18.694
You are that scared of water?

911
01:57:18.765 --> 01:57:20.096
Go in the water

912
01:57:20.166 --> 01:57:24.296
Fish comes, you catch Easy!

913
01:57:37.784 --> 01:57:39.308
How is it?

914
01:57:42.388 --> 01:57:43.514
It's good, sir

915
01:57:44.590 --> 01:57:48.321
It's too salty
This sucks

916
01:57:48.394 --> 01:57:52.922
You should tell it like it is
A person's life depends on it

917
01:57:52.999 --> 01:57:54.330
Too salty?

918
01:57:55.501 --> 01:57:56.832
It tastes good to me

919
01:57:57.804 --> 01:58:01.934
You probably can't taste the salt because
you have a salt bullet in you

920
01:58:02.008 --> 01:58:03.339
Oh yeah?

921
01:58:04.911 --> 01:58:06.344
I died there

922
01:58:08.414 --> 01:58:10.939
Fuck, I did die

923
01:58:11.584 --> 01:58:13.677
And you say you did it to save me?

924
01:58:16.122 --> 01:58:19.751
It was a faulty bullet
You had a 50-50 chance

925
01:58:19.826 --> 01:58:21.350
Let's open

926
01:58:31.437 --> 01:58:32.665
Yes?

927
01:58:35.241 --> 01:58:36.367
Yes?

928
01:58:40.947 --> 01:58:42.574
This-and-that soup for two?

929
01:58:42.648 --> 01:58:46.675
Take this bowl

930
01:58:46.752 --> 01:58:50.381
This is called
This-and-That soup in Korea

931
01:58:50.456 --> 01:58:51.480
OK Ah

932
01:58:51.557 --> 01:58:53.991
I caught all these

933
01:58:54.060 --> 01:58:55.391
Your choice!

934
01:58:55.461 --> 01:58:55.984
It's fresh

935
01:58:56.062 --> 01:58:57.791
Make yourself!

936
01:58:57.864 --> 01:58:59.991
- Just boil it
- OK?

937
01:59:00.066 --> 01:59:01.397
Grab everything
